@EthnovetChat.ServiceLayer_HostAddress = http://localhost:5275

### 1. Service Health Check
GET {{EthnovetChat.ServiceLayer_HostAddress}}/api/chat/health
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. List All Known Diseases
GET {{EthnovetChat.ServiceLayer_HostAddress}}/api/chat/diseases
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. List All Animal Categories
GET {{EthnovetChat.ServiceLayer_HostAddress}}/api/chat/animals
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Search Remedies (e.g., Cow Diarrhea)
GET {{EthnovetChat.ServiceLayer_HostAddress}}/api/chat/remedies?animal=cow&query=diarrhea
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Chat Query - English (Cow with indigestion and off feed)
POST {{EthnovetChat.ServiceLayer_HostAddress}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "message": "My cow is off feed and has indigestion and no rumination. What herbal remedy can I prepare?",
  "animal": "cow",
  "language": "en"
}

###

### 6. Chat Query - Tamil (மாட்டுக்கு வயிறு உப்புசம் / Tympani)
POST {{EthnovetChat.ServiceLayer_HostAddress}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "message": "என் மாட்டுக்கு வயிறு உப்பசம் மற்றும் மூச்சு விடுவதில் சிரமம் உள்ளது, என்ன நாட்டு மருத்துவம் செய்ய வேண்டும்?",
  "language": "ta"
}

###

### 7. Chat Query - Chicken / Poultry Wounds
POST {{EthnovetChat.ServiceLayer_HostAddress}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "message": "What is the traditional treatment for chicken wounds or pecking injuries?",
  "animal": "chicken"
}

